			"url": "https://github.com/home-assistant/architecture/discussions/668",
			"summary": "The opener proposes that the numeric_state trigger fire only when both the previous and new states are valid numbers, so a sensor dropping to unavailable and returning to the same value (for example after a reboot) no longer fires an automation; anyone wanting the old behaviour would combine a state trigger with a numeric condition.",
			"actorId": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MTc0OTE1",
			"actorType": "human"
		},
		{
			"id": "DC_kwDOByplq84AGZMk",
