			"url": "https://github.com/home-assistant/architecture/discussions/668#discussioncomment-1676647",
			"summary": "The opener replies that the current behaviour is a bug contradicting the docs, so a compatibility flag is unwanted; changing the default would fix most automations, and he asks for real cases where the current behaviour helps.",
